error[DS0105]: `as` is SQL, not DataScript
  --> query:1:39
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | summarize count() as n by customerId | project customerId AS id, n
  |                                       ^^ this names a column in SQL
  |
  = help: name a column with `=`, name first: `n = count()`

error[DS0105]: `AS` is SQL, not DataScript
  --> query:1:79
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | summarize count() as n by customerId | project customerId AS id, n
  |                                                                               ^^ this names a column in SQL
  |
  = help: name a column with `=`, name first: `id = customerId`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from 'orders.csv' | summarize n = count() by customerId | project id = customerId, n
which parses without errors
